2026-10-15T16:09:47.1268106Z 7. hint and hash unchanged
2026-10-15T16:09:47.1270430Z   ok     the successor is stored as its SHA-256 hash, exactly as any other regular key
2026-10-15T16:09:47.1270891Z   ok     and its hint is the last four characters of the plaintext
2026-10-15T16:09:47.1271287Z   ok     the stored value has the shape a hash has, not a 50-character plaintext key
